WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Crouching light punch deliberately whiffs as the frame kill.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.800
Ryu guards the back-medium-punch target sequence.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.500
Medium Torbalan opens the guarded sequence with portal support.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.300
Forward heavy kick converts the projectile opening.

5
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.500
Medium Stribog extends the juggle.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.850
Medium-plus-heavy-punch OD Departure establishes the next portal state.
